; as_of hides a forecast close dated after it. rledger's native plugin does
; not read as_of yet, so this case is Python-only for now.
plugin "beancount_options.check_option_expiry" "{'as_of': '2026-10-20'}"

2026-09-01 open Assets:Broker:Options
2026-09-01 open Assets:Broker:Cash
2026-09-01 open Income:Options

2026-09-02 * "Sell to open"
  Assets:Broker:Options  -1 AAPL261016P00230000 @ 2.50 USD
  Assets:Broker:Cash      2.50 USD

2026-11-20 * "Forecast: buy to close"
  Assets:Broker:Options   1 AAPL261016P00230000 @ 0.00 USD
  Income:Options
